    .SYNOPSIS
        Converts a string of key=value pairs into a hashtable.
    .PARAMETER Text
        A string containing lines of key=value pairs.
    .EXAMPLE
        ConvertFrom-KeyValue -Text "User = Admin`n# Comment`nStatus=Active"
